            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 1, you should get [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8). This power will heal you and your teammates for more when using a Repair Pack. This item scales with Max Life and is not only good for survivability, but also for farming Stadium Cash.\n\n## Items\n\nAs for items, in the earlier rounds you should focus on building [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) and Armor. You should get [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6), [Charged Plating](item_b8ca58e7-6ae2-40ee-8618-fe2f32315295) and [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418).",
