            "notes": "## Power\n\nIn Round 3, you get to pick another power and I usually go for [Lindholm Wall](item_a733a6f5-72cd-43cd-a0fd-b1e03fa34753). This power will make your Barrier Shield bigger and stronger.\n\n## Items\n\nYou should be able to afford [Lumerico Fusion Drive](item_3da81000-333c-460a-a1a2-09441bfda9c8) and [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) now. Otherwise, fill the rest of your slots with cheap items that give Health. [Brigitte](hero_8d4e7c27-fb70-4694-9721-2ecf094ef84a)'s Rocket Flail counts as [Melee Damage](stat_melee_damage) for [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) and will give you Armor, [Move Speed](stat_move_speed) and restore Max Life, making you even more tanky.",
